<title>USA: AFTER THE BELL - Silicon Graphics active.</title>
<headline>AFTER THE BELL - Silicon Graphics active.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Silicon Graphics Inc was one of the most active stocks during after-hours trading, falling to 25-1/4 compared with the day's closing price of 26-7/8, traders said on Monday.  </p>
<p>Silicon announced earlier in the day it expected revenues for the second quarter ended December to be lower than the same period for the previous year.</p>
<p>U.S. Robotics Corp was trading unchanged at 71-1/4.</p>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said session one volume was 39,600 shares against Friday's 1,015,500. Session two volume was 151,600. There was no session two on Friday.</p>
